# Boolean model of the fission yeast (S. pombe) cell cycle.
# Reduced 9-node version inspired by Davidich & Bornholdt (2008).
# Under synchronous update it has a single dominant fixed-point attractor
# (the G1 state) reached from the vast majority of initial conditions.
# Reference: Davidich MI, Bornholdt S, "Boolean network model predicts cell
# cycle sequence of fission yeast", PLoS ONE 3(2): e1672, 2008.

targets, factors
SK, Start
Cdc2_Cdc13, !Ste9 & !Slp1 & !Rum1
Ste9, (!SK & !Cdc2_Cdc13 & !Cdc2_Cdc13_active) | (Ste9 & !SK & !Cdc2_Cdc13_active)
Rum1, (!SK & !Cdc2_Cdc13 & !Cdc2_Cdc13_active) | (Rum1 & !SK & !Cdc2_Cdc13_active)
Slp1, Cdc2_Cdc13_active
Cdc2_Cdc13_active, !Ste9 & !Slp1 & !Rum1 & !Wee1_Mik1
Wee1_Mik1, (!Cdc2_Cdc13 & !Cdc2_Cdc13_active) | (Wee1_Mik1 & !Cdc2_Cdc13_active)
Cdc25, (Cdc2_Cdc13 & !Cdc25) | (Cdc2_Cdc13_active & Cdc25)
Start, !Start
